    "body": "STOPPED before claim. The task forbids changes under `.github/` and `scripts/`.\n\nI checked upstream/main at 68d6452612. The gate job already has a 90-minute timeout in `.github/workflows/post-merge.yml`.\nThe report script `.github/scripts/post-merge-report.sh` has no runner identity input. It uses a generic message when no FAIL row exists.\nA complete fix needs changes under `.github/`. An xtask change cannot report after its runner stops.\nThe overlap checks found no open PR for these two files.\n\nI made no claim, branch, or code change. I did not investigate the runner hosts. The cause of the host failures remains unknown.\n",
    "author_association": "COLLABORATOR",
