    "body": "Runner stop, 2026-11-22: post-merge run 45028887961 (commit 49aaaaa60) on runner `uma`. The job `gate` ended as a failure at 13:57:29Z, 15 minutes after its start. The step \"Batch gate tier\" has no conclusion and no log, and the gate summary has no FAIL row. The workflow opened #3440 for it. I started the run again one time (attempt 2, on `len-pm`).\n",
