    "body": "Runner log, 2026-11-22: the runner `egg` cannot complete the batch tier in the step limit of 75 minutes when the `app` test binaries must be built.\n\nRun 45051365934 (commit 6e641dac7, the tip of `main`), job `gate` on `egg`, 17:47:03Z to 19:02:40Z:\n- \"gate step TIMEOUT after 75 min; last started step: [484] app suites: circular_stay_down\". No FAIL row and no STALL row. Each step that ran is green.\n- Build steps: geometry 25 s, kernel 41 s, cl 4 s, tools 11 s, post 164 s, sim 88 s, motion 196 s, **app 3199 s (53 minutes)**, gpu 49 s, ui 209 s. The builds took about 66 minutes of the 75.\n- The test steps are fast on this runner: about 470 steps in the last 9 minutes.\n- `egg` builds with `-j 12`. The earlier run 45045638947 on `egg` (commit deb5364ee) also ended in the `app` build, at the old limit of 45 minutes.\n\nFor comparison, run 45051255800 (commit 43217a7c4) on the runner `cheese` is green in 64 minutes for all steps.\n\nWhat this means:\n- The cause is not a stop of the runner. The `app` build of about 650 test binaries takes 53 minutes on `egg`. With the tests after it, the run needs about 85 to 90 minutes. That is over the step limit of 75 and near the job limit of 90.\n- A second run on `egg` is faster only if the `app` test binaries of the same commit are still in its `target/`.\n\nAction: the run is started again one time (19:05Z). If it ends on the limit again, the main session asks the maintainer about a higher limit, a lighter post-merge tier, or the removal of `egg` from the label `camcraft-post-merge`.\n",
